etC6H5+iC4H5=C8H9x+C4H6Z2	         1.1E12	0.0	13.1E3          !<estimated(t")>! 
etC6H5+nC4H5=C8H9x+C4H6Z2	         1.1E12	0.0	13.1E3          !<estimated(t")>! 
